    (property "Note" "EN's (CHIP_PU's) delay capacitor (#14 A2, #11 F7): Espressif advises 'an RC delay circuit at the CHIP_PU pin ... usually R = 10 kohm and C = 1 uF' [ds logic/ESP-HARDWARE-DESIGN-GUIDELINES-ESP32S3.pdf p.11]. The Matrix fits the R (R8, 10k to its 3V3) and no C, and EN runs down the ribbon and across this board to HDR-SERVICE. 1 uF against R8 is 10 ms, past the 50 us t_STBL [ds ESP32-S3-datasheet-v2.2.pdf Table 2-13]. At J-MCU pin 24, returned to J-MCU's grounds. Key1, a jumper or an adapter's open-collector reset still pulls it low at once" (at 127.00 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
